WEBVTT

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.000
Men hvis I hopper i,

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.000
husk endelige at slukke for lyset.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.000
Men jeg advarer jer,

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.000
det er vanedannende.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.000
Tak.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:24.000
(Bifald)